# Dubious Delicacy has Flash: Bot1 casts it during Bot2's turn 2, after Bot2's Ornithopter resolves. Two sources of mana are not
# enough for {2}{B} (the refusal on turn 1), three are. The target of "up to one target creature" is optional: Bot1 chooses nobody, so
# the Ornithopter lives. "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Target opponent loses 3 life." is the other ability of the same cost: Bot2 goes
# from 20 to 17, not 18 or 16, and the Delicacy is sacrificed. Bot1 itself is no target opponent (the refusal before it).

